      "writtenOn": "2026-07-30T19:02:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Previously:\n- The declaration of `skgpu::MakeInterface` in `VulkanUtilsPriv.h` listed `(..., physDevVersionOut, instanceVersionOut)`, but the actual definition in `VulkanUtilsPriv.cpp` listed them in the reverse order: `(..., instanceVersionOut, physDevVersionOut)`.\n- Graphite and VMA both assumed the _declaration_ order of `physDev,instance` was correct, **which ended up with Graphite and VMA looking at `instanceVersionOut` when they meant to look at `physDevVersionOut`.**\n- Ganesh followed the actual _definition_ order, so it ended up looking at the correct value, even though that wasn\u0027t the contract claimed by the declaration.\n\nWith this CL:\n- The declaration in .h has been updated to align with the definition in .cpp.\n- Graphite and VMA have been updated to the new declaration order, which now matches the definition order correctly.\n- Ganesh doesn\u0027t need an update, since it was already passing its arguments in the \"wrong\" order (that happened to match the actual definition).\n\nDoes that SGTY?",
      "parentUuid": "2693fec6_677ddb1e",
      "revId": "ce4e28697f78241b5d5e97221fb8b5c19d6f1a02",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
